            "message": "Promised integration test 'Affected native/adoption/repository/MCP/routing regressions preserve legacy and design behavior' has no corresponding test in any Story test file (adoption, repository, probe, gateway, provider-lane or recovery suites) and is not listed in reportedTests.",
